    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An ideal first-time buyer or owner-occupier home\nPositioned overlooking a large open green area and directly opposite Ballybane Church, this attractive home enjoys a pleasant and unusually open outlook to the front, creating a wonderful sense of space and privacy.\nThe property is presented in excellent condition throughout and has been exceptionally well cared for by its owners. Importantly, the house has never been rented, and this is evident in the standard of presentation. It is exceptionally clean, bright and well maintained, offering a genuine turnkey opportunity for its new owners.\nInternally, the accommodation is particularly appealing, with generously proportioned living accommodation, excellent natural light and a warm, welcoming atmosphere throughout. The rooms are well laid out and provide comfortable and practical accommodation for modern family living.\nTo the rear, the property benefits from a substantial private garden, providing an excellent outdoor space with considerable potential for gardening, entertaining or simply enjoying some valuable private space.\nThe location is another major attraction. Castlepark is a well-established residential development on the east side of Galway City, with excellent access to Ballybane, Mervue, Ballybrit, Parkmore and Briarhill, as well as ATU Galway and the wider city. There are regular bus services nearby, while local shops, schools, medical facilities and a host of everyday amenities are all within easy reach.\nFor those looking for a home that combines excellent condition, bright and spacious accommodation, a large rear garden and a particularly pleasant outlook, No. 302 Castlepark represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a very well-maintained home in a highly convenient Galway City location.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
