        "Content": "<ul><li> Excellent condition throughout </li><li> Owner occupied and never rented </li><li> Bright and spacious living accommodation </li><li> Pleasant open outlook overlooking a large communal green </li><li> Directly opposite Ballybane Church </li><li> Substantial private rear garden </li><li> Well-established residential development </li><li> Close to ATU Galway and a wide range of local amenities </li><li> Close to ATU Galway and a wide range of local amenities </li><li> An ideal first-time buyer or gilt edge investment with no rent cap</li></ul>"
